 "change": "DEV3 Row: explicit transaction executor in A's statement driver (begin_transaction_live, transaction_insert_live, commit_transaction_live, rollback_transaction_live over a caller-held Option<RowTransaction>; one Explicit slot; a failed statement is rolled back to its mark and the transaction continues; a fenced transaction empties the holder), with the autocommit steps made generic and unchanged. New two-sided F4 ceilings BEGIN 2,816 and STATEMENT_START 3,584 B, fitted on C's side by a same-behavior C product change in row_start.rs (never-inlined Row lifecycle actions returning an input packet; Row lifecycle 42,089 -> 40,881 B, charge 44,304 and short cap unchanged). The table issue (CatalogFull statement call) stays a C residual with no ceiling: this is narrower than the user's card and is flagged in the PR together with the C product change. Tests LXT-A01..A07, LXT-J01..J05. Called only by tests.",
